[[0,1201435,0,5,1,4,"2016-07-30T04:09:00","elgindelta","",[],"","nominate for v/SBBH song for the weekend. because, slooters like @mick and @fuzzywords and the hammer swingers should have solid sonic representation.","http://youtu.be/sZTpLvsYYHw","SoapboxBanhammer"],[1,5939059,0,4,0,4,"2016-07-30T05:41:19","SlothropAnAbreaction","",[],"<p>Surprisingly delicate choice, I honestly don't know how to react. If it had been the standard shit people usually spew on here, or a rickroll even, I'd just ignore it. It's just not worth the effort.</p>\n<p>But this... What the fuck, man. This gave me flashbacks to highschool parties and happiness, pleasant, easy going memories... <a href=\"https://streamable.com/3xao\">What the hell</a>?</p>\n<p>... Banned, four hours. Think about all the pain and anguish you've caused with this, your entirely valid and considerate nomination.</p>"],[2,5942846,5939059,1,0,1,"2016-07-30T19:07:03","elgindelta","",[],"<p>Geyy </p>"]]
